// Edge shadow diagnostic.
// Deliberately bypass texture sampling and VDP1 mesh stipple so we can prove
// that the textured/subdivided GXM geometry reaches the fragment stage.
// If this solid surface appears, the remaining fault is in the shadow
// texture/alpha sampling path rather than geometry or draw submission.
float4 main()
{
    return float4(1.0f, 0.0f, 1.0f, 1.0f);
}
